[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14402.79, "timestamp": "04:00:02", "text": "不过，我忘了提一下……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14409.79, "timestamp": "04:00:09", "text": "再次嵌入内容，我必须手动操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14412.349, "timestamp": "04:00:12", "text": "每次都得自己打开，因为我做不到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14415.349, "timestamp": "04:00:15", "text": "找到让它保持开启状态的设置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14419.07, "timestamp": "04:00:19", "text": "默认情况下，我认为你必须重用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14421.469, "timestamp": "04:00:21", "text": "你的设置和你制作时一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14423.71, "timestamp": "04:00:23", "text": "你的直播，那就是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14426.38, "timestamp": "04:00:26", "text": "使用 ah all"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14428.55, "timestamp": "04:00:28", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14430.63, "timestamp": "04:00:30", "text": "有时候，当你创建一个新东西时，情况就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14433.469, "timestamp": "04:00:33", "text": "流媒体没有这个选项"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14435.87, "timestamp": "04:00:35", "text": "启用了或者我不知道其他什么功能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14438.51, "timestamp": "04:00:38", "text": "我知道，我的意思是，我想这已经过去很久了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14440.429, "timestamp": "04:00:40", "text": "自从我上次说话以来，我一直在说话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14442.26, "timestamp": "04:00:42", "text": "流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14449.83, "timestamp": "04:00:49", "text": "等等，你还没说完呢，继续说 X"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14452.429, "timestamp": "04:00:52", "text": "直播……呃，请稍等片刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14459.59, "timestamp": "04:00:59", "text": "这就是《Left for Dead》的剧情。"}]